@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@providerToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_PROVIDER_TOKEN
@missionToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_MISSION_TOKEN
@offeringId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@scopeRevisionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@assignmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@tenantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@systemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
@directoryId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006
@subscriptionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007
@relationshipId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008
@capabilityId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009
@releaseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010

# Manual local examples only. Replace placeholders from exact authorized GETs.
# POSTs persist metadata. Do not run a file-wide send or use production tokens.
# Provider token never substitutes for mission membership or an assigned RMF role.

### Read-only: full count and a page of immutable hosting scopes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/hosting-scope-revisions?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Read-only: exact retained revision, including historical revisions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/hosting-scope-revisions/{{scopeRevisionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Explicit local mutation: first technical scope (not authorization coverage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/hosting-scope-revisions
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: local-hosting-scope-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedOfferingRevision": 1,
  "predecessorRevisionId": null,
  "name": "Synthetic mission hosting",
  "permittedScopes": [
    {
      "cloud": "AzureCloud",
      "directoryTenantId": "{{directoryId}}",
      "subscriptionId": "{{subscriptionId}}",
      "resourceId": "/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/resourceGroups/mission"
    }
  ],
  "exclusions": [],
  "citations": []
}

### Read-only: existing allocations; total counts assignment records, not systems
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/hosting-assignments?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Read-only: exact allocation (also the create response Location)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/hosting-assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Explicit local provider mutation: technical metadata for an EXISTING system
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/hosting-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: local-hosting-allocation-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetTenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "systemId": "{{systemId}}",
  "hostingScopeRevisionId": "{{scopeRevisionId}}",
  "assignedScopes": [
    {
      "cloud": "AzureCloud",
      "directoryTenantId": "{{directoryId}}",
      "subscriptionId": "{{subscriptionId}}",
      "resourceId": "/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/resourceGroups/mission"
    }
  ],
  "references": []
}

### Read-only: Microsoft references, filtered before total and paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/authorization-records?recordKind=InheritedMicrosoftReference&page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Read-only: selected mission's existing allocations and persisted associations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/provider-relationships?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{missionToken}}

### Explicit local mission mutation: association ONLY; no request/grant/adoption/coverage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/provider-relationships
Authorization: Bearer {{missionToken}}
Idempotency-Key: local-association-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": "{{assignmentId}}",
  "expectedAssignmentRevision": 1
}

### Optional explicit relationship preview; NOT required for technical association
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/provider-relationships/{{relationshipId}}/previews
Authorization: Bearer {{missionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": 1,
  "expectedAssignmentRevision": 1,
  "relationshipState": "SeparateBoundaryConsumer",
  "authorizationRevisionId": null,
  "boundaryRevisionId": null,
  "evidence": [],
  "rationale": "Explicitly retain separate mission authorization."
}

### Optional review: copy exact preview ID/hash/revision; covered review additionally requires AO
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/provider-relationships/{{relationshipId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{missionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": 2,
  "previewId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
  "previewHash": "COPY_EXACT_PREVIEW_HASH",
  "rationale": "Confirm the displayed separate-boundary relationship, not an ATO."
}

### Read-only: exact published offering contexts for the selected existing allocation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/applicable-provider-capabilities?assignmentId={{assignmentId}}&offeringId={{offeringId}}&environment=AzureCloud&page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{missionToken}}

### Explicit ISSM/ISSO-only local mutation: canonical subscription plus exact pins
# Pure MissionOwner gets 403. This does not confirm responsibilities or issue authorization.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/provider-capability-adoptions
Authorization: Bearer {{missionToken}}
Idempotency-Key: local-adoption-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": "{{assignmentId}}",
  "expectedAssignmentRevision": 1,
  "capabilityId": "{{capabilityId}}",
  "releaseId": "{{releaseId}}",
  "contextSnapshotHash": "COPY_EXACT_APPLICABILITY_SNAPSHOT_HASH",
  "applicabilityPreviewHash": "COPY_EXACT_APPLICABILITY_PREVIEW_HASH"
}

### Read-only invalid paging: 400 error envelope, not truncated success
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/hosting-assignments?page=1&pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
